\begin_layout Chapter
Image class overview
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The image class stores image data together with various meta-data.
 Several image processing operators are provided as Image class methods.
 When possible and appropriate,
 the meta-data associated to an image are kept in the resulting image.
\end_layout

