\begin_layout Section
Indexing and dimensions
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The data are stored as a 5-dimensional array.
 The dimensions correspond to the X,
 Y,
 Z,
 channel,
 and frame axes,
 in that order.
 In particular,
 grayscale or intensity images are stored with dimensions 1 and 2 permuted compared to Matlab representation.
\end_layout

