\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
Moments 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
A binary region 
\begin_inset Formula $X$
\end_inset

 may be described mathematically by its
\series bold
 geometric moments
\series default
 
\begin_inset Formula $m_{pq}$
\end_inset

 of order 
\begin_inset Formula $(p,q)$
\end_inset

.
 Moments up to the order 2 may be summarized by an equivalent ellipse,
 or equivalent ellipsoid in 3D.
\end_layout

